config BR2_PACKAGE_NOTO_EMOJI
	bool "noto-emoji"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_FONTCONFIG
	help
	  Noto Color Emoji: colour emoji font (CBDT bitmaps, needs
	  FreeType with PNG). Fontconfig uses it as the fallback for
	  emoji the other fonts lack, so they are not drawn as boxes
	  in the terminal, the bar, notifications and the browser.

	  https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji
